desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "检测到 Playwright 暴露 Chrome 远程调试端口"
	title_zh: "检测到 Playwright 暴露 Chrome 远程调试端口",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-playwright-exposed-chrome-devtools"
	risk: "security-misconfiguration"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
远程调试协议不执行任何认证，过度暴露调试端口存在安全风险，可能被任意来源访问。

### 风险类型
安全配置不当（security-misconfiguration）

### 影响
安全相关配置缺失或过于宽松，可能暴露敏感功能或降低整体防护能力。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE-94
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
不要暴露远程调试端口，或仅绑定本机回环地址并限制访问来源。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.js": <<<POS
const { chromium } = require('playwright');
const args = ['--remote-debugging-port=9222'];
POS
	"safefile://neg.js": <<<NEG
const { chromium } = require('playwright');
// no remote debugging flags
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/require\(\s*['"]playwright['"]\s*\)/) as $ctx
$ctx.regexp(/--remote-debugging-(?:address|port|socket-name|targets)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "检测到 Playwright 暴露 Chrome 远程调试端口",
	title_zh: "检测到 Playwright 暴露 Chrome 远程调试端口",
	message: "检测到 Playwright 暴露 Chrome 远程调试端口",
}
